        "TileImage": "$($repository 138078d6-0e9f-4e27-8ffb-373d6bbc6b62).Image",
        "Description": "Hello again 47, having accepted and concluded the contract in Mendoza a few days ago, we deduce that you accept our offer to be a part of our organization. Just as a reminder, the two targets elimminated in Mendoza were a couple of bankers who had embezzled money from their clients and used it to afford a luxury life and had also covered up the case and retired to Mendoza so that we forget them.\r\rNow, your next targets are two women who have a secret meeting to exchange a confidential document.",
